      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b65796ff-4ad1-5936-9b53-1ba60192c11e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon\n- Companies: Westfield Group\n- Places: Westfield Parramatta, Westfield Doncaster, Beech Forest, Victoria\n- People: Cliff Young\n- Topics: Shopping centres\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Cliff Young won the inaugural Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon at age 61.\n- Cliff Young was an Australian potato farmer and athlete from Beech Forest, Victoria.\n- Cliff Young’s full name was Albert Ernest Clifford \"Cliff\" Young, and he was born on 8 February 1922 and died on 2 November 2003.\n- The Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon was sponsored by the Westfield Group.\n- The Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon started at Westfield Parramatta shopping centre.\n- The Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon finished at Westfield Doncaster shopping centre, formerly known as Doncaster Shoppingtown.\n- Westfield Parramatta has an approximate net leasable area of 137,407 square metres.\n- Westfield Parramatta contains 498 shops across five levels.\n- Westfield Parramatta is Australia’s fourth largest shopping centre by Gross Leasable Area.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "cebd08d1-55e1-5976-a748-3319744f6dac",
        "text": "Page: Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon. Sentence: It was sponsored by the Westfield Group, with the start being at Westfield Parramatta shopping centre and the finish at Westfield Doncaster shopping centre (formerly known as \"Doncaster Shoppingtown\").\nPage: Westfield Parramatta. Sentence: It has a net leasable area of approximately 137,407m² and contains 498 shops built over five levels, making it Australia's fourth largest shopping centre by Gross Leasable Area (GLA).\nPage: Cliff Young (athlete). Sentence: Albert Ernest Clifford \"Cliff\" Young, OAM (8 February 19222 November 2003) was an Australian potato farmer and athlete from Beech Forest, Victoria, best known for his unexpected win of the inaugural Sydney to Melbourne Ultramarathon in 1983 at 61 years of age.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
